e_name": "screenshot02.png", "id": "1167270421589414", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473393425_1167270424922747_1907140739452079368_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=uF2r4DNOlUYQ7kNvwHtO6Fa&_nc_oc=Adrjzhjd0mu_ublcnsr6KjMMTOGVtyEFxef8ohAEqP_XRgHu2kw6ArudjR9815Q1B_U&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQN4Bst6wpH2M3b2mmGsliZ61Ai_V8CbV3NWK-s2t4YOGA&oe=6ACE4979"}, {"file_name": "screenshot03.png", "id": "1320236425766559", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473392005_1320236429099892_7026969068655260219_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=MeWLEXxUPy8Q7kNvwEpl1py&_nc_oc=AdruS6c29idzE-eJFJ47HlNYzdh_3r4fQc6i1b33xIjXbUCfVV88hs2zv4EUOse_txg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQNsLZjDfINnC19zrRjiXsGb6Y_xauzedqZ5YdBd4ZLaEQ&oe=6ACE5913"}, {"file_name": "screenshot04.png", "id": "1408931723813604", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391949_1408931727146937_1574658016866773147_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=3_1rluwHhFkQ7kNvwHm6p3w&_nc_oc=Adq1g5cxo2-LE-Bu1qjUg87l3-ha07LlbDNRJVG5OJ-nm8uyU3FjQyEQxzOjnpjtcVE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQPblsp897hhtgWA4buh9Pi41flII1lrv5o5WdiSe-cUIw&oe=6ACE64BB"}, {"file_name": "screenshot05.png", "id": "418176134719567", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391998_418176138052900_6204508764481913331_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=4rEm7Ls1f7AQ7kNvwF69zu7&_nc_oc=Adp-CLaCqJdY_97c56DofAgzZy21IzsN-MaA7uuSKZ-rAVfTwEect13FSUq5QQW9QF0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQOVqhc2Iw-EOViQu2qx_d06z74pEf-psMXafQa5x43KXQ&oe=6ACE660A"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "thumbnail2.png", "id": "1152565683077389", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391896_1152565689744055_250834400001166292_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Qv9tjsGgs78Q7kNvwEgqCbZ&_nc_oc=Adod8D9UMZjDei7T3qjx8ZuspO7pPX157Ze_eq9-s0Np4qwRj3ryKDnJycJwkLpb0zc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQOKzHUa4w98fY1gOlSI6RGEMKQRnmZS0PTb4HMW4m-JlA&oe=6ACE4F3E"}, "display_name": "Aerodrums 2", "keywords": [], "long_description": "This is the companion app for the Aerodrums 2 air drumming instrument (sold separately). Seamlessly connect to your Aerodrums 2 device over WiFi and see your drum kit materialize before your eyes. Choose your kit, jam to your favorite tunes, practice with a metronome, or record your performances. No Aerodrums 2? No problem! The app will let you play a basic drum kit in mixed reality using hand-tracking.\n\nAerodrums 2 is an expressive and versatile air drumming instrument. It is a standalone device that uses high-speed optical motion capture technology to accurately track the position of your drumsticks and feet in 3D. Unlike acoustic and traditional electronic drum sets, Aerodrums 2 is lightweight and portable, it is silent when used with headphones, and it takes up no space when not in use.\n\nPaired with Meta Quest headsets, Aerodrums 2 offers an unparalleled drumming experience. Passthrough mode and depth occlusion let you see your real hands and drumsticks while drumming, while hand-tracking is used to further improve stick-tracking accuracy.\n\nTo learn more about Aerodrums 2 visit aerodrums.com", "short_description": "This is the companion app for the Aerodrums 2 air drumming instrument (sold separately). Seamlessly connect to your Aerodrums 2 device over WiFi and see your drum kit materialize before your eyes. Choose your kit, jam to your favorite tunes, practice with a metronome, or record your performances. No Aerodrums 2? No problem! The app will let you play a basic drum kit in mixed reality using hand-tracking."}]}, "developer_name": "Aerodrums", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://aerodrums.com/privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_se